        "6e96d1ddd5b7b300f9cc": "Here's the Violet Powder, $N. Take it to Marin and tell him he owes me a favor!",
        "7230759607cb7b6c5678": "Oh, $N, you're finally back.  What have you brought?",
        "d026b09ebbfe0cab852b": "Violet Powder, eh? Let's give it a try -- it sure couldn't make it any worse, that's for sure!"
      },
      "summary": "Sprinkle wants to you take the Violet Powder to Marin Noggenfogger in Gadgetzan.",
